        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 235)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.113">Section 16.52.113</a> REPEALED (Vehicle Left in Garage for Storage – When Deemed Abandoned – Notices – Disposal)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 236)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.116">Section 16.52.116</a> REPEALED (Disposition of Vehicles – Procedure)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 237)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.117">Section 16.52.117</a> REPEALED (Abandoned Vehicles or Hulks on Private Property)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 238)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.1172">Section 16.52.1172</a> REPEALED (Notice of Impoundment – Hearing)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 239)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.145">Section 16.52.145</a> REPEALED (Abandoned Junk Motor Vehicles – Definitions)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 240)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.150">Section 16.52.150</a> REPEALED (Abandoned Junk Motor Vehicles – Authorizing Disposal – Record)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 241)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.160">Section 16.52.160</a> REPEALED (Violations Constituting Abandoning – Evidence – Penalty)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 242)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.170">Section 16.52.170</a> REPEALED (Abandoned Vehicle – Pre-impoundment Notice)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 243)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.180">Section 16.52.180</a> REPEALED (Removal Authorized)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 244)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.190">Section 16.52.190</a> REPEALED (Post-impoundment Notice – Hearing)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 245)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.195">Section 16.52.195</a> REPEALED (Post-impoundment Procedures)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 246)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.52.200">Section 16.52.200</a> REPEALED (Reacquisition of Vehicle)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
